WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 2, Scene 13h: Adel sealing and Lunatic Pandora
Duration: ~40 seconds
Source: FF8 FMV — Esthar military, Adel containment, Lunatic Pandora exterior

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
An Esthar platform at sunset. Teal railings frame a vast circular arena where soldiers stand in concentric rings.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Closer view of the assembled Esthar forces, figures gathered at the center of the formation.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Rows of glowing pink energy cubes pulse with light. Containment barriers hum with power.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Overhead view of red-haired figures arranged in a circle, arms outstretched. A ritual or sealing ceremony.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Extreme close-up of Adel's face. Blue-tinged skin, blank white eyes half-open, red hair framing her features. She is sealed and dormant.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.700
Lunatic Pandora floats above a red desert at sunset. The massive dark monolith bears a scorpion emblem, hovering motionless over barren earth.
